Subject: [PATCH v2 02/10] dt-bindings: media: mediatek,jpeg: Remove dma-ranges property
Date: Wed, 8 Feb 2023 13:36:35 +0800
Message-ID: <20230208053643.28249-3-yong.wu@mediatek.com>
